.TH TILEMAP_BOX_HITS 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
tilemap_box_hits \- Whether any solid tile overlaps the world\-space rectangle box
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtilemap.h\(dq
.BI "bool tilemap_box_hits(const Tilemap *m, const Rect *box);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Whether any solid tile overlaps the world\-space rectangle box. Checks every tile the box touches (a box exactly on a tile edge does not count the neighbouring tile). The primitive behind tilemap_move(); use it directly for "can this be placed here" and for non\-moving overlap tests.
.SH RETURN VALUE
true if box overlaps a solid tile.
.SH MODULE
tilemap (src/engine/tilemap/tilemap.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tilemap_move (3),
.BR tilemap_solid_at (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
